  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Daughters of Charity of St Vincent de Paul PROJECT: The project aims to facilitate and ensure HIV/AIDS prevention, STD control including HIV/AIDS, ccare and treatment; and to encourage optimum adherence in order to improve PLWHAs&#x2019; health outcomes with the provision of high quality, holistic, easily accessible and affordable and comprehensive HIV/AIDS healthcare services in Nigeria.  An integral aim is to prevent mother to child transmission of HIV infections and zero HIV-related morbidity and mortality.</narrative>
  </description>
